OL,3,GNEWSAWhy council plans to offer
OL,4,Abuildings to advertisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FCash-strapped Worcestershire County
OL,7,FCouncil said it will offer buildings
OL,8,Fand other assets to advertisers in a
OL,9,Fbid to generate income.
OL,11,FThe move opens up the prospect of
OL,12,Fadverts appearing on council offices,
OL,13,Fbus shelters, libraries and other
OL,14,Famenities.
OL,16,FIt comes as the authority faces an
OL,17,Funprecedented #98m funding shortfall
OL,18,Ffor 2027/28, having to rely on
OL,19,Femergency government support.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
