OL,3,GNEWSAWhy council plans to offer
OL,4,Abuildings to advertisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Adam Kent, the deputy leader
OL,7,Fand cabinet member for finance, said:
OL,8,F"I'd invite anybody who's interested in
OL,9,Fadvertising on council assets to come
OL,10,Fforward and give us their proposal."
